UTIOM — Licensing Map
=====================

Copyright © 2026 Reza Adineh. All rights reserved except for the rights expressly granted under the applicable licence below.

UTIOM uses a split licensing model. Different parts of the public ecosystem have different terms.

1. Framework, methodology, Book, diagrams and public framework documentation
   Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0).
   See LICENSE-FRAMEWORK.md.

2. Software and self-hosted implementation
   PolyForm Internal Use License 1.0.0.
   See LICENSE-SOFTWARE.md.

3. Assessment workbook and free assessment instruments
   Free personal, internal organisational, educational, academic-research and practitioner-evaluation use under the UTIOM Free Assessment Use Terms.
   See LICENSE-ASSESSMENT.md.

4. Future enterprise and commercial product functionality
   Not granted under the public/free licences. APIs, automated evidence collection, continuous assurance, integrations, benchmarking, multi-team workflows, enterprise reporting, access controls, managed services and other unreleased or commercial capabilities remain proprietary unless separately licensed in writing.

Free access or public availability does not transfer ownership of UTIOM, its software architecture, product implementation, unreleased intellectual property or future enterprise capabilities.

Historical copies remain governed by the licence under which those copies were originally released. Nothing in this licensing map attempts to revoke rights already granted for earlier copies.

